        "contract": "met",
        "family_confirmed": null,
        "evidence": "claim explicitly labels the indexed pocket and gloved swap 'Speculative capability'; delta uses stipulated strips, slots, bolts and optional recoverable wire, with no assumed gate lifting. prediction contrasts light seating pressure in capture with reduced-pressure friction-clamp drift and states 'Equal success would leave that distinction unresolved.' probe supplies at most two configurations, capped runs/checks, final spare, gloves and early stops; pull-scale limits and unknown forces remain explicit. This is a bounded, observable enabling comparison with defeat conditions and clear usefulness, while unverified geometry/stiffness/access keep fit uncertain. B-1aa5662eb58727acfd4a already asks guides versus pressure-only retention and clearance/drift, so local novelty is equivalent; pair judgments resolve the stated pressure-reduction question separately from magnetic comparisons."
